  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Prep ingredients: Bring a large saucepan of salted water to the boil for the ravioli. Quarter the zucchini lengthwise, then cut into 2cm chunks. Cut the tomato into 3cm chunks. Coarsely chop the parsley, including the stems. Crush or finely chop 2 garlic cloves.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/236425/photos/large/prep_ingredients-2dab32c67c45bdef219e8213e2bccd38.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make stock: Crumble 1 stock cube into a heatproof jug, add 60ml (¼ cup) boiling water and stir to dissolve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/236426/photos/large/make_stock-efe9afe08923a0bf16d30c0d357368c2.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook ravioli: Cook the ravioli in the pan of boiling water for 5 mins or until al dente. Reserve 60ml (¼ cup) cooking water, then drain the ravioli.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/236427/photos/large/cook_ravioli-16db0894a80b98cb8cc80ef5a7b74b7b.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make sauce: Meanwhile, melt 20g butter in a medium deep frypan over medium heat. Add the pepitas and cook, stirring occasionally, for 1-2 mins until the butter is browned and smells nutty. Add the zucchini and garlic and cook for 2-3 mins until just tender. Add the stock and bring to the boil, then remove the pan from the heat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/236428/photos/large/make_sauce-1a2d7a73579350be4f4fa6f1bee15a18.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve up: Add the tomatoes, ravioli, reserved cooking water and half the parsley to the zucchini mixture. Season with salt and pepper and toss to coat. Divide the ravioli among bowls, scatter over the remaining parsley and enjoy.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/236429/photos/large/serve_up-5ed36e61ef101e17b00f16de0dedd41a.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make it yours: If you like a kick of heat, scatter over a pinch of chilli flakes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/236430/photos/large/make_it_yours-5a135469be4a11bb953b73c9f626720f.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
